 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "Is there a setup fee? "
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "No. There are no setup fees, onboarding fees, or surprise charges. You pay the monthly or annual plan price and that's it."
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "Can I switch plans later? "
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "Yes. Email us at "
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "support@localboostlab.com"
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "k": "text",
  "en": " and we'll switch your plan within 24 hours. Upgrades take effect immediately; downgrades take effect at the next billing cycle."
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "What payment methods do you accept? "
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "We use Stripe for all payments. Stripe accepts all major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Discover). We do not accept ACH, checks, or PayPal at this time."
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "What happens if I cancel mid-month? "
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "We don't issue prorated refunds for partial billing periods. Your service continues through the end of the period you already paid for. We remove GBP access immediately upon cancellation confirmation."
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "Do you offer discounts for multiple locations? "
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "Yes: if you have 3 or more locations, email "
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "support@localboostlab.com"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "k": "text",
  "en": " for a multi-location quote. We typically offer 15–25% off per additional location."
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "Do prices include tax? "
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "k": "text",
  "en": "No. Prices shown are before applicable sales tax. Stripe will calculate and apply any required taxes based on your billing address at checkout."
 },
